  "description": "Don't miss this one! If you are looking for a spacious one bedroom apartment right in the much sought after area of Rathmines & within a heartbeat of the city centre, this one must be recommended. Situated in the ever popular Seven Oaks development with its beautiful green open space and mature trees, the location is situated equidistant between Ranelagh and Rathmines villages and but a hop from the Luas at Dunville .This top floor apartment consists of an entrance hallway, double bedroom with built in wardrobes, attractively fitted kitchen/living room , quality bathroom with shower &  storage room . Surface parking is also available . Please register your interest by email to arrange viewing.",
